hnormal" style=3D"margin-right:0.03148em">k</span><span class=3D"mclose">)<=
/span></span></span></span> time at each index.</p>
<p>To improve this approach, we'd need a way to efficiently access the mini=
mum value at each of these ranges. A <strong>min-heap</strong> would be per=
fect for this.</p>
<p><strong>Min-heap</strong><br>
